! ENARSI-EIGRP-VRF-01 初期 RT03 (テナントB site1 CE・設定済/変更禁止)
! ★172.16.10/11.0/24 はテナントAと意図的に重複(VRF分離の実効を証明する素材)
interface Loopback1
 ip address 172.16.10.1 255.255.255.0
!
interface Loopback2
 ip address 172.16.11.1 255.255.255.0
!
interface Loopback3
 ip address 172.16.30.1 255.255.255.0
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 ip address 10.20.1.1 255.255.255.252
 no shutdown
!
router eigrp 200
 network 10.20.1.0 0.0.0.3
 network 172.16.10.0 0.0.0.255
 network 172.16.11.0 0.0.0.255
 network 172.16.30.0 0.0.0.255
 no auto-summary
!
